---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/compare/callteam-vs-callbox/"
title: "CallTeam vs Callbox: Pricing and Campaign Pods"
seoTitle: "CallTeam vs Callbox: Pricing and Campaign Pods"
description: "Compare CallTeam’s US$4,000 monthly starting price with Callbox’s US$7,334 campaign pod. See what extra pods cost and when to choose managed calling."
canonicalUrl: "https://www.callteam.ca/compare/callteam-vs-callbox/"
contentLanguage: "en-CA"
ogType: "article"
modified: "2026-11-17"
pageStyles:
  - "/assets/css/lead-providers.css"
  - "/assets/css/simple-buying-guide.css"
  - "/assets/css/process-video-preview.css"
  - "/assets/css/callbox-comparison.css"
---
{% set guide = callboxComparison %}
{% from "components/process-video-preview.njk" import processVideoPreview %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}",
      "name": {{ title | json | safe }},
      "description": {{ description | json | safe }},
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ site.websiteId }}" },
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb" },
      "mainEntity": { "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#article" },
      "inLanguage": "{{ contentLanguage }}"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#article",
      "headline": {{ title | json | safe }},
      "description": {{ description | json | safe }},
      "mainEntityOfPage": { "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage" },
      "author": { "@id": "{{ site.organizationId }}" },
      "publisher": { "@id": "{{ site.organizationId }}" },
      "dateModified": "{{ modified }}",
      "inLanguage": "{{ contentLanguage }}",
      "about": [
        { "@id": "{{ site.organizationId }}" },
        { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Callbox", "url": "https://www.callboxinc.com/" }
      ],
      "citation": [{% for key, source in guide.sources %}{{ source.url | json | safe }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}]
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{ site.url }}/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Outbound Sales Library", "item": "{{ site.url }}/resources/outbound-sales-library/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "CallTeam vs Callbox", "item": "{{ canonicalUrl }}" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<main class="lp-page callbox-page" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">CallTeam vs Callbox</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>CallTeam vs <span>Callbox</span>
          <small>Pricing and campaign pods</small>
        </h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">CallTeam can build your list, run the calls and handle follow-up. We give sales the reason each qualified buyer agreed to meet. Callbox suits teams that want several channels or markets managed together.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare prices and scope <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="lp-text-link" href="#calling">See what a call uncovers <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief callbox-price-brief" aria-labelledby="callbox-two-pods">
        <h2 id="callbox-two-pods">Two Callbox pods</h2>
        <p class="callbox-hero-price">{{ guide.twoPods }}<span> / month</span></p>
        <p>Callbox’s estimator multiplies the starting rate by the number of pods. Ask for a quote by market and language.</p>
        <a href="#pod-pricing">See the pod estimates <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#comparison">Price table</a><a href="#pod-pricing">Pod estimates</a><a href="#calling">Calls and results</a><a href="#choose">When to buy</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section callbox-first-section" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>CallTeam vs Callbox pricing</h2>
      <p>CallTeam offers managed calling. Published prices and scope checked <time datetime="{{ guide.checkedDate }}">{{ guide.checkedLabel }}</time>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table callbox-table" role="table">
        <caption>Starting price, delivery and sales handoff</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">What to compare</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">CallTeam</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Callbox</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Starting price</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam"><strong>From {{ guide.callTeamMonthly }} per month</strong>. We can include list research and fresh contact data in your quote.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox"><strong>{{ guide.callboxMonthly }} per month</strong> for one campaign pod.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Outreach</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam">We make the calls, leave voicemails and use approved voicemail drops. We handle callbacks and agreed follow-up.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">Phone, email and LinkedIn. Callbox also lists web retargeting among its channels.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Team and coverage</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam">A managed calling team for your agreed audience, with extra markets scoped in your proposal.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">One SDR plus a support team for a buyer group. Research, campaign management and multilingual coverage are available within the quoted scope.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">What sales receives</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam">A qualified booking with the buyer’s reason for meeting, timing and agreed next step in your CRM.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Callbox">Qualified appointments, weekly reporting and a campaign dashboard. Agree which notes and statuses will reach your CRM.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-sources"><a href="/pricing/">CallTeam pricing</a> · <a href="{{ guide.sources.callboxPricing.url }}">Callbox pod calculator</a> · <a href="{{ guide.sources.callboxFaq.url }}">Callbox quote factors</a></p>
    <div class="callbox-pod-estimates" id="pod-pricing">
      <h3>How much do extra Callbox pods cost?</h3>
      <dl>{% for estimate in guide.podEstimates %}<div><dt>{{ estimate.label }}</dt><dd>{{ estimate.total }}<span> per month</span></dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl>
      <p>These are calculator estimates. Your quote depends on team size, languages and market coverage. Ask what you would pay to add a buyer group after launch.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="calling"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading">
      <h2>When a call is worth making</h2>
      <p>Use a live call to find out who owns the work, how they handle it today and when they would consider a change. That gives you a reason to book, follow up later or move on.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-two callbox-proof">
      {{ processVideoPreview('How CallTeam calls and qualifies buyers', 'See how we choose accounts, follow up and give sales a reason for each appointment.', 'callteam-vs-callbox') }}
      <article class="callbox-case">
        <h3>18 booked meetings in 90 days</h3>
        <p>For an outsourced financial research provider, we asked finance buyers where extra help could fit into live deals. That led to specific conversations about modelling, company comparisons and deal support.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies/financial-services-appointment-setting/">Read the financial services case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="callbox-channel-note">Use LinkedIn to find the right contact and email to send the detail they asked for. <a href="{{ guide.sources.gong.url }}">Gong Labs</a> observed a 3.44% email reply rate when outreach included a cold call and 1.81% for outreach with no calls.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="choose"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Which service fits your campaign?</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-pair callbox-decisions">
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>Hire CallTeam for calls and follow-up</h3>
        <p>Choose CallTeam when the buyer’s answers should guide the next call or handoff. CallTeam’s starting price is {{ guide.startingPriceGap }} a month below Callbox’s published one-pod estimate.</p>
        <a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">See the CallTeam appointment-setting service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>Choose Callbox when you need several channels or markets</h3>
        <p>One team can handle research and outreach, which helps when you lack that support in-house. Ask who will work each market, which languages they cover and what counts as a qualified appointment.</p>
        <a href="{{ guide.sources.callboxAppointments.url }}">See how Callbox handles appointments <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta">
      <p><strong>Want CallTeam to run your outreach?</strong> Tell us who you need to reach and what your sellers need before each meeting.</p>
      <a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="callteam-vs-callbox">Book a free 30-minute call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="callbox-quote-link">Send both providers the same brief. Ask for the monthly bill, first invoice date and full term. <a href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare your quotes side by side <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>CallTeam vs Callbox FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in guide.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section callbox-sources" id="sources"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Sources</h2></div>
    <ul>{% for key, source in guide.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p>For more providers, see the <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/">B2B lead generation pricing report</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</main>
